<span class="ltx_bibblock">Smarter, Better, Faster, Longer: A Modern Bidirectional Encoder for Fast, Memory Efficient, and Long Context Finetuning and Inference.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">arXiv:2412.13663.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib58" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zekun et al. (2023)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Zekun, L.; et al. 2023.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Multi-Class Bias Classification Using Distil-BERT.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib58.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">EMNLP</em>.

</span></li>
      
